## Troubleshooting Guide

### Backend Health Check Fails

```bash
# Check database connectivity
docker-compose exec backend python manage.py dbshell

# Check Redis connectivity
docker-compose exec backend python -c "import redis; r = redis.Redis(host='redis', port=6379, db=0); r.ping()"

# Check environment variables
docker-compose exec backend env | grep -E 'DB_|REDIS_|AI_SERVER'
```

### AI Server Health Check Fails

```bash
# Check model weights path
docker-compose exec ai ls -la /app/ai_model/models/

# Check logs for model loading errors
docker-compose logs ai | grep -i error

# Verify GPU access (if using GPU)
docker-compose exec ai nvidia-smi
```

### docker-compose Build Fails

```bash
# Check disk space
df -h

# Clean up old images (safe: only removes dangling images)
docker image prune

# Check build logs
docker-compose build --no-cache backend 2>&1 | tee build.log
```

### Service Communication Fails

```bash
# Verify service name resolution
docker-compose exec backend ping -c 1 ai

# Verify port accessibility
docker-compose exec backend nc -zv ai 8001

# Check service logs
docker-compose logs backend | tail -50
docker-compose logs ai | tail -50
```
